[TRANSMISSION INCOMING]

Dear astronauts, the half of the [b]G.Round Playtest[/b] month is already behind us! We are grateful to everyone who joined us on this journey.

🚀 During the playtesting, we received many unique thoughts from you about the game, which gave us some ideas on how to make the game even more exciting for you. Each week we choose the most valuable feedback and send the G.Points rewards to them. Also, the game build was updated along the way:

- All found [b]bugs[/b] fixed;
- Missing [b]voiceovers[/b] to the ship AI added;
- [b]Puzzles and hints[/b] improved;
- New [b]cube appearance[/b] added.

📃 Few days ago, we added a [b]Survey[/b] on G.Round, and we ask you to fill it out! Just like the reports on the Tanmi ship that Martin wrote to move on and impact the ending, you will contribute significantly to the game's improvement with your answers!

So check the new build of Cognition Method and join us for the next two weeks in Alpha-playtesting at G.Round! We are looking forward to your reviews!

[TRANSMISSION ENDED]
